return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T08:25:56+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T08:25:56+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Ta hosting Zinn Digital® lati ori aaye WordPress tirẹ — WordPress, WooCommerce, ile-iṣẹ, reseller, cloud ati VPS hosting. Wa ki o si funni ni awọn agbegbe lati akọọlẹ reseller rẹ, fowo si awọn alabara rẹ taara sinu nronu hosting wọn, ati pese hosting laifọwọyi nigbati a ba san aṣẹ WooCommerce kan.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Pẹpẹ agbalejo naa dahun pẹlu ipo %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Wá orúkọ ìdánimọ̀ rẹ','Search'=>'Wá a','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'A kò ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn ìfikún èyíkéyìí fún orúkọ yẹn.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Àwárí agbègbè kò sí lórí ojú-òpẹ́ yìí fúngbà díẹ̀.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Àwa kò lè dé ọ̀dọ̀ ìforíkọ́lu ìtumọ̀ domain ní àkìsí yìí. Jọ̀wọ́ gbiyanjú lẹ́kan síwájú ní ìṣẹ́jú kan.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.'=>'Bọtìní API náà ti sonù tàbí kò tún wúlè mọ́. Ṣàyèwò rẹ̀ lábé Zinn Digital® → Reseller Toolkit.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Bọtìlì API yii ko ni igbanilaaye sites.view, eyiti wiwa agbegbe nilo. Fi kun bọtìlì naa ninu igbimọ oniṣowo rẹ, tabi mu bọtìlì naa kuro nibi lati pada si wiwa ti gbogbo eniyan.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Àwọn aláṣẹ nìkan ló lè rí èyí:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí – gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan si','Already registered'=>'Ti forukọ silẹ tẹlẹ','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Ó wà — béèrè iye owó lọ́wọ́ wa','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'O wa — %1$s %2$s fún ọdún akọkọ','Register it'=>'Forukọ silẹ','Manage my hosting'=>'Ṣàkóso ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù mi','Please sign in first.'=>'Jọwọ wọlé kọkọ.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Ko tii si àkọọlẹ yi ti a so mọ iṣẹ ìgbékalẹ wẹẹbu kan sí.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbalejo náà kò dá ìjápọ̀ wọlé sílẹ̀.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Apamọwọ Olùtàjà','Account'=>'Akawọ','Features'=>'Àwọn Ẹ̀yà Ara','Styling'=>'Àṣà fúnra rẹ̀','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI (MCP)','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Gbà fún àwọn aṣojú AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Pa: àwọn ohun èlò tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ àti àwọn ọ̀nà REST wọn kò ní ìforúkọsilẹ rárá.','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Akọọlẹ olùtà taara Zinn Digital® rẹ','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ṣẹda bọ́ọ̀lù aṣàròkọ API reseller kan ninu daṣibọọdu Zinn® rẹ labẹ Developer → API keys, ki o si lẹ mọ́ ibi yìí.','Reseller API key'=>'Bọtìlì API ti Olùtajà Tuntun','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'A nì í sórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí nìkan, a kò sì ní fi kún ìwé ìgbé-jáde tàbí ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò rárá.','Plan to provision'=>'Ètò láti pèsè','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Koodu eto ti a fi awọn alabara tuntun si. Fi silẹ ni ṣofo lati le beere ni gbogbo igba.','API address'=>'Adirẹsi API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ayafi ti atilẹyin Zinn® ba beere lọwọ rẹ lati yipada.','Control-panel address'=>'Adirẹsi ìṣàkóso bọ́ọ̀dù','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Ibikẹẹti ti ọna aṣopọ “My hosting” n fi awọn onibara rẹ ranṣẹ si.','Domain search'=>'Àwárí agbègbè wẹ́bù','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Pese kúkúrú koodu [zinn_domain_search] sílẹ̀','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Fi shortcode náà sórí èké èkejì èyíkéyìí láti jẹ́ kí àwọn alábẹ̀wò ṣàyẹ̀wò agbègbè kan kí wọ́n sì ra a nípasẹ̀ rẹ.','Panel link'=>'Ọna asopọ pátákì','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Fi ọna asopọ “Ohun-ini mi” han si awọn alabara ti o wọle','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Pínpèsè WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Pèsè hosting láìṣeégbàgbé nígbà tí ìbéèrè WooCommerce bá parí','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí àwọn àṣẹ tí ó ní ọjà kan tí o ti fi sí ètò Zinn® nìkan.','Domain search appearance'=>'Ìfarahàn ìwádìí agbègbè ayélujára','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Widget yii n ṣe afihan inu akori ti ara rẹ. Yan eto tẹlẹ kan, tabi ṣeto awọn awọ ti ara rẹ — ni ọna kankan ko si ohun ti a fi kun si awọn oju-iwe rẹ ti alejo le ri bii tiwa.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'Gbogbo kilasi ti wigieti naa nlo ni a ṣe akoṣo rẹ sinu faili readme ti plọọgiini naa, nitorinaa olùgbékalẹ̀ sọfitiwia le sọ ohunkohun di asan ti iṣeto tẹlẹ ko le bo.','Follow my theme'=>'Tẹ̀lé àkòrí mi','Soft'=>'Rírọ̀','High contrast'=>'Iyatọ giga','Compact'=>'Rẹpẹtẹ','Buy-link colour'=>'Àwọ̀ ìjápọ̀ ìràwọ̀','“Available” colour'=>'Àwọ̀ tó wà fún lílò','“Could not check” colour'=>'Àwọ̀ "Kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò"','Error colour'=>'Àwọ̀ àṣìṣe','Corner rounding'=>'Yiyo igun','Space inside each row'=>'Ààyè inú ìlà kọọkan','Text size'=>'Iwọn ọrọ','Domain-name weight'=>'Àwọn agbára orúkọ agbègbè','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí bọ́tìnnì API olùtà fúnni.','Domain search already works without one, at the public prices. The panel link and WooCommerce provisioning need a key: create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Developer → API keys.'=>'Àwárí agbègbè ti ń ṣiṣẹ́ tẹ́lẹ̀ láìsí rẹ̀, ní àwọn owó gbangba. Ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ pẹ́lììlì àti ìpèsè WooCommerce nílò bọ́tìnì kan: dá ọ̀kan sílẹ̀ nínú apá kan àbójútó Zinn® rẹ̀ lábẹ́ Developer → API keys.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Ṣí daṣibọọdu Zinn® mi','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'A ti ṣeto bọtọ kan, ṣugbọn kò si ohun ti o tan.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Kò sí nínú àwọn ẹ̀yà mẹ́ta yìí tí ó wà ní ìmúṣẹ, nítorí náà àfikún yìí kò ṣe ohunkóohun lórí ojú-wẹ́bù rẹ. Mú èyí tí o nílò ṣiṣẹ́ lábẹ́ Àwọn Ẹ̀yà (Features).','Open Features'=>'Ṣii Awọn Ẹya','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Ó ti ṣetan — ohun àrà %d ti wÀ ní títàn.','Selling from'=>'Tita lati','Settings'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ̀','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Kò tíì sí bọ́tìnnì API kankan, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a ti sopọ̀.','Not connected: %s'=>'Ko sopọ: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'A ti sopọ. Eto olutaja rẹ jẹ %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ko si bọtini API Zinn® kan ti a tunto, nitorina ko si ohun ti a pese.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Àṣẹ yìí kò ní orúkọ agbègbè kankan nínú, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè pèsè.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Pẹpẹ ìgbalejo náà kò dá ojula kan padà.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'Ìpèsè ohun èlò ayélujára Zinn® fún %1$s (iṣẹ́ %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Pẹpẹ gbigiho ko pada si akọọlẹ alabara kan.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Àì ṣe ìdàgbàsו́kì ìgbalejò Zinn®: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Ìlà ọjà Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Laini ọja Zinn® lati pèsè nigbati o ra ọja yii. Fi silẹ ni ṣofo lati lo aiyipada lati awọn eto afikun.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Gbigi Zinn®','Service id'=>'Àmì iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Kò sí ohunkohun tí a pèsè fẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ́ fún ìbéèrè yìí.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Ti fipamọ. Tẹ iye tuntun kan lati rọpo rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí...','Filter this list'=>'Ṣe àlẹ̀mọ àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá àlẹmọ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi ìlà kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ila yii','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Àìníwo','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo afikun Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò nílò àsopọ̀ kankan fún plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí awọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati yipada awọn eto wọnyi.','Settings sections'=>'Awọn apakan Eto','Support'=>'Atilẹyin','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada','Tools'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ́','Export settings'=>'Ṣe agbejade awọn ètò','Reset to defaults'=>'Tun unṣe sí ipinlẹ aiyipada','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí máa mú gbogbo ètò inú plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí padà sí ipò ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ wọn. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Awọn iwadii fun atilẹyin','Import a settings file'=>'Gbe faili awọn eto wọle','Import'=>'Wọle','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn faili ti a gbe wọ jade ko ni awọn ọrọ igbaniwọle, awọn token tabi awọn bọtini API ninu rẹ - iwọ yoo nilo lati tẹ awọn wọnyi sii lẹẹkan si lori aaye tuntun naa.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò náà pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lori plugin yii ti padanu si ipilẹṣẹ rẹ.','Done.'=>'Wọn ti ṣe é.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A ko le ka faili yẹn. Yan faili awọn eto ti o ti gbe jade lati inu ohun elo afikun Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìfiránṣẹ́ àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kọ́ jẹ́ ìṣejade ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Aṣọ yẹn ti jẹ wíwọlé láti inú plọọgìnnì míràn (%s), nítorí náà wíwọlé rẹ̀ wá síhìn-ín yoo fipamọ́ àwọn ètò tí plọọgìnnì yìí kò yé.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Àwọn ètò %d ni a kó wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API kì í wà nínú ohun tí a kó jáde, nítorí náà ẹ tún wọn ṣe.','Connected'=>'Asopọ','Connecting…'=>'Ńsopọ…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Asopọ ti sopọ, ṣugbọn nkan kan nilo ifarabalẹ','Not connected'=>'Ko sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Wiṣe lori akọọlẹ tirẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Àlámọ̀ yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Fi ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́, a ó sì wo ọ̀rọ̀ náà.','Connection status'=>'Ipo asopọ','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A ti ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kẹ́yìn ni %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ṣí ní tàbù ìtàkùn tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi eyi ranṣẹ si atilẹyin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí ni déedé ohun tí a óò ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohùn tí ó pamọ́. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà rẹ, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀, àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àkàkọ sí pátákì àkójọpọ̀ mímú-fún-lò','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tìkẹ́tì àtìlẹ́yìn fún ọ, a sì dáhùn nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì. Bí o bá fẹ́ràn kí o má ṣe fi í ránṣẹ́, da ẹ̀kọ́ rẹ̀ sí òkè, kí o sì lẹ mọ́ inú tìkẹ́tì fúnra rẹ̀.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati sevha yii (%s). Da iroyin oke kọ ati ṣii tikẹti dipo rẹ — ko si ohun ti ko tọ si awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® gba ijabọ rẹ — itọkasi %s — yoo si fesi nipasẹ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìjábọ̀ ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú mélòó kan kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si — àwọn tí tẹ́lẹ̀ wọlé dé gan-an.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ko le gba ijabọ ná característica yẹn báyìí — ìyẹn wà lára wa, kì í ṣe tirẹ. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan si ní di ìgbà díẹ̀, tàbí da ijabọ tí ó wà lókè yẹn sínú tikẹ́tì kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ ìròyìn náà sílẹ̀ (HTTP %d). Da a sọ́kàn kí o sì ṣí tíkẹ́tì kan, ní sísọ nọ́mbà yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — awọn amọna ati awọn iṣẹ','User guides'=>'Awọn itọnisọna olumulo','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ìgbàlejò Zinn® fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfẹ́hìntì lójoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó ṣeé lò fún àwọn èèyàn tó ń darí ju ojú-wọ̀n kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn ibi ti a ti n gbe awọn ọna asopọ kalẹ ti o ti fi idi mulẹ, lak ti o ti n tọju owo naa ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn oníṣẹ́ọwọ́ káríayé wa: ṣíwò fún àwọn iṣẹ́ tó ti ṣetan jẹ́jẹ́ tó lé ní 10,000 láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn ònkọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá sọfitiwia àti àwọn olùgbéga SEO, tàbí kí o fi iṣẹ́ kan sórí afẹ́fẹ́ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún ní iye owó.','Style preset'=>'Ìṣètò àwọn àṣàyàn ìrísí','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ kan. Ohunkohun tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ bori rẹ̀.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo awon awco ati iwọn temi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ki a si lo eto naa gẹgẹ bi o ṣe wa gangan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo awọn akọsilẹ ifilọlẹ Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® ko fun ni ọna asopọ igbasilẹ fun imudojuiwọn yii. Ṣayẹwo pe aaye yii le de ọdọ pẹpẹ Zinn®, lẹhinna tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ko ṣe e ṣe lati ṣe igbasilẹ imudojuiwọn na lati iṣẹ imudojuiwọn Zinn® (%s). Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbàlàwé tí a ṣe àgbéjọ rẹ̀ kùnà àyẹ̀wò òtítọ́ rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sílẹ̀.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'A kò lè parí ìṣe náà. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, tó bá tún kùnà, kàn sí alábòójútó ojú-wẹ́bù náà.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Ojutu to nilo ko si tabi o ni awọn iṣoro. Ṣayẹwo iṣeto igbewọle agbara naa.','The site refused the request.'=>'Ojula kọ ìbéèrè náà.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Jẹ́ kí àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI bíi Claude, Cursor tàbí VS Code ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojú-wẹ́bù yìí fún ọ nípasẹ̀ MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wọ́n ń wọlé gẹ́gẹ́ bí olùlò WordPress pẹ̀lú ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà ìwọ̀lé (application password) wọ́n sì lè ṣe ohun tí a gbàyè aṣoju olùlò yẹn láti ṣe nìkan.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Àwọn olùrànlọ́wọ́ AI nílò WordPress 6.9 tàbí àwọn tí ó tẹ̀ lé e. Ṣe imudojuiwọn WordPress láti lo wọn.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Adirẹsi asopọ (opin MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ṣẹda ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà ìṣètò fún olùṣe rẹ','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Fi èn sí àwọn ètò MCP ti ìṣírò AI rẹ, pẹlu orúkọ olùlò rẹ ati ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà yẹn:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: fi akọsilẹ kanna si abẹ "servers" ninu .vscode/mcp.json, ki o maṣe fi si abẹ "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ti oluranlọwọ AI le lo nibi (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Itọsọna olumulo: Awọn aṣoju AI ati MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Àwọn ìwé ìtọ́nisọ́nà fún àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá sọfitiwia: àwọn agbára, REST àti MCP','Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site.'=>'Ṣàkóso àwọn oníbàárà hosting rẹ, àwọn ètò wọn àti àwọn ojú-wọ̀ṣẹ́ wọn lórí Zinn Digital® láti ojú-wọ̀ṣẹ́ yìí.','Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account.'=>'Awọn alabara rẹ, awọn eto wọn ati awọn aaye wọn, nipasẹ akọọlẹ alagbata Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Read your reseller account'=>'Ka akọọlẹ olutaja rẹ','Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up.'=>'Ó dá ìròyìn àkọọ́lẹ́ olùtà-ṣàtúnṣe rẹ padà ní ẹ̀kan ṣoṣo: àmì, àwọn ètò, iye àwọn oníbàárà àti iṣẹ́, àti ohun tí a ti ṣètò.','List your clients'=>'Ṣe àkójọ awọn alabara rẹ','Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit).'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn àkáǹtì oníbàárà rẹ̀, ojú ewé kan ní ẹ̀kan náà (kọ́ṣọ̀ọ̀sì, àlà).','Create a client'=>'Ṣẹ́dá oníbàárà kan','Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site.'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá àkáǹtì oníbàárọ̀ kan lábẹ́ tirẹ̀ (name; default_currency, kóòdù lẹ́tà mẹ́ta). Fi sí ojú ọ̀nà ètò kan kí ojú òpó wẹ́bù wọn àkọ́kọ́ tó dé.','Read a client\'s plan'=>'Ka ètò Oníbàárù','Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id).'=>'Ó dá ètò wo tí oníbàárùkọ wà lórí àti iye tí ó jé fún ọ (client_id).','Put a client on a plan'=>'Fi onibara sori ètò kan','Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site.'=>'Fi onibara sori ọkan ninu awọn eto rẹ (client_id, plan_code; interval: oṣu tabi ọdun). Ṣe eyi ṣaaju aaye akọkọ wọn.','List the plans you can sell'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ àwọn ètò tí o lè ta','Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it).'=>'Ó ṣe àkójọ àwọn ètòìgbale kháchì (hosting plans) àti àwọn iye owó wọn (product_line àti currency ti sọ ọ́ di dín-dín).','List your clients\' sites'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ àwọn ojú-wẹ̀bù àwọn oníbàárà yín','Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time.'=>'O ṣe àkọsọ ohun gbogbo ti o ti pèsè fún àwọn oníbàárà rẹ (client_id àti status dín ìwọ̀n yìí kù), ojú ìwé kan nígbà kan.','Create a site for a client'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá ojú-wẹ̀bù kan fún oníbàárà kan','Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client\'s plan, as from your shop.'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá ojú òpó wẹ́bù tí a gbàlejò fún ọ̀kan lára ​​wọn (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). A óò gbógun ẹ̀sùn náà sórí àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ lórí ètò alabara náà, gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ti wá láti ilé ìtajà rẹ.','Suspend a client\'s site'=>'Daduro aaye alabara kan','Puts a client\'s site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended.'=>'Ó fi ojú súwònnì sí ojú-wọ́wọ́ oníbàárà kan nítorí àìsanwó (site_id; ìdí: àkọsílẹ̀ rẹ, tí a kì í fi hàn oníbàárà rẹ̀ láé). Ojú-wọ́wọ́ náà yóò dáwọ́ iṣẹ́ dúró títí a ó fi tún un gbé kalẹ̀.','Unsuspend a client\'s site'=>'Mú kí ojula alabara padà sípò','Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id).'=>'Ó mú ìdènà àìsanwó kúrò, nítorí náà ojú òpó wẹ́bù náà tún ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i (site_id).','Read the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Ka àwọn ètò Irinṣẹ́ Olùtàrí (Reseller Toolkit)','Returns this plugin\'s settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Ó dá àwọn ètò plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí padà (àdírẹ́sì API, ètò tí àwọn àṣẹ tuntun ń lò, àwọn ẹ̀yà wo ni ó wà ní títàn). Kò ní dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ API padà láé, àfikún sí i nìkan ni pé bóya a ti fi pamọ́.','Change the Reseller Toolkit settings'=>'Ṣati awọn eto irinṣẹ Alatunta','Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only.'=>'Ó ṣe àwọn àyípadà sí àwọn ètò tí o ránṣẹ́ (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) ó sì pa àwọn tó kù mọ́. Bọ́tínì API àti àdéréṣì náà wà nípa ìyípadà lórí ojú-ìwé náà nìkan.','Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first.'=>'Fi bọtọni API olutaja Zinn Digital® rẹ sori iboju Ọpa Olutaja ni akọkọ.']];